              "content": "• Expose cycleAssignments arrays on tickets\n• Sort assignments by track position\n• Replace assignments only when cycleAssignmentsSet is true\n• Support repeated cycle filters with AND semantics\n• Support unplannedTrack filters\n• Activity events include trackId, trackKey, oldCycleId, and newCycleId",
