              "content": "• Seed default tracks automatically or ask users to enable planning?\n• Ship custom track creation now or constrain to templates?\n• Should Milestone use multi_active or none by default?\n• Allow Cycles as default project view immediately or after timeline stabilizes?\n• Keep strict AND cycle filters from day one or expose OR groups later?",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
